  "rationale": "D3 of the growth-clock spec for inverse flames, data-informed (not zero-shot): D1 with a pressure term in the early quench clock (+0.5 per e-fold, level re-centred so that 2.2 atm is unchanged). The diffusion of ambient fuel to the young flame makes the life lengthen with pressure; on train D1 is too long at 1.1 atm in two sessions and too short at 3.3 atm in one. Every number typed by the author; no fit, no search; no validation outcome was read, the validation conditions were.",
